WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.173
Engineer a flying fish across biological
scales. MorphoSwarm Frontier connects

2
00:00:05.173 --> 00:00:09.828
design goals to equations, simulations,
and shared open questions.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.251
Search a thousand imported Delphi claims,
with citations and evidence gaps. Explore

4
00:00:16.251 --> 00:00:18.856
genomic proposals and organism models.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.165
Watch recorded molecular motion, cell
voltages, pattern formation, fluid flow,

6
00:00:26.165 --> 00:00:29.864
and collective behavior—with validation
limits visible.

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.342
Specialists build; reviewers challenge.
One independent review caught incorrect

8
00:00:34.342 --> 00:00:39.648
fin print files, and the shared project
preserved and corrected them.

9
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.115
Choose experiments that distinguish
explanations. Nebius and Google Cloud

10
00:00:45.115 --> 00:00:47.956
